# Jev, the agent router (apps/desktop/src/modules/jev).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in the repository root — that is where the desktop
# dev launcher reads it from, and it is gitignored. The launcher folds it into
# the environment it hands Electron, so the key reaches the main process and
# nothing else; it never crosses the bridge into the renderer.
#
# Without it the router still appears in the partner picker and still answers
# every send — with "not configured", and the default partner. Routing is the
# only thing that reads this; nothing else in the app does.
#
# It is read fresh on every call, so rotating the key costs an app restart and
# nothing more.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
